      "association_estimand": "Descriptive pooled and management-stratified Spearman rank correlations of ordered moisture with observed per-site plant richness in exactly these20 archived sites. The question is whether the pooled direction is a consistent description of every sampled management category,not a population hypothesis test.",
      "inference_scope": "The cited public archive documents these20 field sites but does not establish independent random sites or a valid free-label null randomization for this question. Report empirical direction heterogeneity only;do not turn conventional asymptotic p-values into ecological directional evidence or intervention effects.",
      "direction_policy": "Compare signs using tolerance1e-12. A management category opposes the pooled direction only when its defined within-category correlation has the strictly opposite nonzero sign. A zero or undefined within-category correlation is not an opposing sign. Undefined correlations must be null,not fabricated0."
